	(text "Values per TI SLUS810N:\nR3 ISET 1.2k: charge 890 A-ohm / 1.2k = 0.74 A (0.66-0.81)\nR4 ILIM 1.5k: input limit 1610 / 1.5k = 1.07 A (EN2=1 EN1=0)\nR24 TMR 68k: fast-charge timer 10 x 48 s/k x 68k = 9.1 h\n(6.8 h min; the 5 h default can stop a 3.5 Ah cell early)\nR5 TS: fixed 10k, temperature check off (no NTC in the\nholder). Swap for a 10k NTC on the cell to enable it.\nTD low = termination on at 10 %. Thermal pad to GND with\nvias: ~1 W at 3.6 V cell, TJ(REG) 125 C throttles beyond."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
