	(text "Pots across +3V3A; frame tabs to GND. Direction\nper axis is a firmware setting. C18-C21 at the\nESP32 pins: charge reservoir for the ADC sample cap.\nMode 2: left Y throttle, left X yaw, right X roll,\nright Y pitch. Left Y self-centres; remove its\nspring for a throttle that stays put."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.2 97.79 0)
